  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 9c94e8900bdbef942ad19f626cdac685, type: 3}
  m_Name: Horizontal_Scene3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sceneHeader: Scene 3
  sceneSubHeader: Reading and Printing
  NarrationBeats:
  - narrationText: "Swarms of catalytic PKA awaken processes within the nucleus.\r"
    narrationTrack:
      Guid:
        Data1: -1794675190
        Data2: 1227082527
        Data3: 633996168
        Data4: -61203013
      Path: event:/VO/scene_03_01
  - narrationText: "Eventually, the nucleus spools out strands of insulin messenger
      RNA. \r\r"
    narrationTrack:
      Guid:
        Data1: 1973494961
        Data2: 1332301741
        Data3: 1113243541
        Data4: 301735619
      Path: event:/VO/scene_03_02
  - narrationText: "mRNA acts as an insulin template to be read by another macromolecule,
      the ribosome.\r\r\r"
    narrationTrack:
      Guid:
        Data1: 1772047452
        Data2: 1316123230
        Data3: -980619843
        Data4: -537010244
      Path: event:/VO/scene_03_03
  - narrationText: "Ribosomes attached to the surface of the Endoplasmic reticulum
      reel in these insulin mRNA strands and meticulously translate it molecule by
      molecule.\r\n\r\r\r"
    narrationTrack:
      Guid:
        Data1: 1057425773
        Data2: 1295638855
        Data3: -2066801757
        Data4: -211721606
      Path: event:/VO/scene_03_04
  - narrationText: While reading the mRNA, each ribosome simultaneously extrudes
      a corresponding preproinsulin strand inside the Endoplasmic Reticulum.
    narrationTrack:
      Guid:
        Data1: 470941448
        Data2: 1130913651
        Data3: -1293036137
        Data4: 692226104
      Path: event:/VO/scene_03_05
  - narrationText: "When an mRNA\u2019s translation is finished, a complete preproinsulin
      strand breaks off from the ribosome and travels further into the inner workings
      of the Endoplasmic reticulum.\r"
    narrationTrack:
      Guid:
        Data1: -1700334208
        Data2: 1156667077
        Data3: -1780213076
        Data4: -764154616
      Path: event:/VO/scene_03_06
